# Duskwood, Alliance ~22.7 to ~25.4.
#
# Route from the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export, visit 5:
# Duskwood 22.7-25.4), written out as a playable guide; not play-tested on
# Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Darkshire (every quest giver, the Bronze Tube from Herble) -> the
# Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> west along the road: Watcher
# Dodds, Raven Hill (Memory of Valor, Skeletal Horrors and Fiends), Sven's
# camp, the Raven Hill Cemetery and Abercrombie (wolves, spiders, ghouls) ->
# back east: Watcher Dodds, the Yorgen Farmstead -> hearth to Darkshire, Blind
# Mary -> west: Abercrombie, Sven -> Darkshire -> the
# Skeletal Horrors south-east of town (Rot Blossoms) -> Darkshire -> west: Abercrombie, the
# ghouls, Jitters, Sven (the end: ride north through Elwynn to Stormwind for
# training, Shamans in Ironforge by the Deeprun Tram, and the Auberdine boat
# from Stormwind Harbor, where the next guide starts).
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Look To The Stars (174): the export finds the Bronze Tube on Venture Co.
#   machines in Stonetalon (a 1-2% drop). Herble Baubbletump sells it in
#   Darkshire, next to Viktori; the turn-in stays where the export has it, in
#   the Duskwood return (07-thousand-needles).
# - Wolves at Our Heels (226) is turned in on the second visit to Sven's camp
#   (Lars stands beside Sven) instead of walking back west for it.
# - Hearthstone: the export hearths twice on the first loop (23.7 and 24.4);
#   here once from the Yorgen Farmstead and once after the second western loop,
#   so the cooldown allows both.
# - The Darkshire flight path and hearth bind belong to the export's Redridge
#   visit (it arrives here bound); repeated in the first step in case you come
#   in without them.
# - Dropped Awaiting Word (236): a no-XP breadcrumb to Watcher Callahan at
#   Manor Mistmantle, a detour north the route never passes otherwise.
#
# Class quests: Rogues finish Mathias and the Defias with Klaven's Tower
# (2360, 2359, Poisons) at the end: Agent Kearnen and the tower stand just
# over the Westfall border from Raven Hill, and Mathias Shaw is in Stormwind
# on the way to the boat. Optional for Rogues there: The Touch of Zanzil
# (2607-2609, Doc Mixilpixil in the Barracks cellar; Wildflowers, a Leaded
# Vial and a Bronze Tube from Stormwind vendors, the thread in the city),
# 1,305 XP without leaving Stormwind.
#
# Left out (not in the export): Jitters' Growling Gut and Dusky Crab Cakes
# (163, 5, 93), Seasoned Wolf Kabobs (90: Cooking), The Weathered Grave chain
# (225: ends at the elite Mor'Ladim), Ira's Dagger (96137: it starts from a
# drop of the Lost Stalkers, Forever's new Duskwood mobs, at an unknown rate,
# and is not in the new consensus either).
# Refresh (2026): Merrick's Bow (96138) now has a known start, a drop of the
# Lost Watchers; the new consensus does it at 28 with the ogres of Vul'Gol,
# so it is an optional extra in 07-thousand-needles' Duskwood return. The
# Valor Family (98447, a Forever quest Wowhead lists for Duskwood, level 27)
# is not in our data: no giver, objective or ender we can place, so it is
# not added. The Valor Family 96139 (Sirra Von'Indi) stays as it is.
# Checked and skipped: The Legend of Stalvan (98) needs 97 (the Stalvan
# chain through Westfall and Elwynn, not on this route) and ends at Stalvan
# Mistmantle, an elite.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshire

step Darkshire
  tip Follow the road south from Three Corners into Duskwood; Darkshire lies on the east side of the forest.
  getfp "Darkshire" npc 2409              -- Felicia Maline, at the north end of town
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790            -- Innkeeper Trelayne, Scarlet Raven Tavern
  accept 101                              -- Madame Eva, in her house by the tavern
  accept 56                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in the town hall
  accept 96139                            -- Sirra Von'Indi, in the house behind the town hall
  accept 164                              -- Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town
  accept 165

step Viktori Prism'Antras
  tip Viktori's house stands at the east end of town. Herble Baubbletump sells engineering goods in the house beside it.
  accept 174                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras
  buy 4371 x1 npc 3133                    -- Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump: limited stock. Sold out? Neal Allen in Menethil Harbor sells it too.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tranquil Gardens

step Tranquil Gardens Cemetery
  tip Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house on the hill. Every skeleton in Duskwood can drop a Skeleton Finger.
  kill 48 quest 56                        -- Skeletal Warrior
  kill 203 quest 56                       -- Skeletal Mage
  collect 2378 quest 101                  -- Skeleton Finger
  collect 2794 optional                   -- An Old History Book: a rare drop from Duskwood's mobs
  accept 337 optional

step Darkshire
  turnin 56                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  accept 57
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West

step Watcher Dodds
  tip Watcher Dodds stands south of the road, at the Yorgen Farmstead.
  accept 245

step Raven Hill
  tip Continue west to Raven Hill. The Memory of Valor glows by the ruined house south of the road.
  collect 281046 quest 96139              -- Raven Hill Tome, from the Memory of Valor

step Raven Hill Cemetery, south
  tip The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  kill 202 quest 57                       -- Skeletal Horror
  kill 531 quest 57                       -- Skeletal Fiend
  collect 2378 quest 101                  -- Skeleton Finger

step Sven's Camp
  tip Follow the road north-west past the cemetery to Sven's camp on the far west edge of the forest. Lars stands beside Sven.
  turnin 164                              -- Sven Yorgen
  accept 95
  accept 226                              -- Lars

step Abercrombie
  tip The hermit's shack stands in the woods north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery.
  turnin 165
  accept 148

step Wolves, spiders and ghouls
  tip Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders crawl east of the cemetery and drop the venom. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang.
  kill 565 quest 226                      -- Rabid Dire Wolf
  kill 213 quest 226                      -- Starving Dire Wolf
  kill 539 quest 245                      -- Pygmy Venom Web Spider
  collect 1130 quest 101                  -- Vial of Spider Venom
  collect 1129 quest 101                  -- Ghoul Fang

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back east

step Watcher Dodds
  tip Ride back east along the road to the Yorgen Farmstead.
  turnin 245

step Yorgen Farmstead
  tip The mound of loose dirt lies south of the farmhouse, by the old stump.
  turnin 95                               -- Mound of loose dirt
  accept 230

step Darkshire
  hearth "Darkshire"
  turnin 96139                            -- Sirra Von'Indi
  turnin 57                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  turnin 101                              -- Madame Eva
  turnin 148
  accept 149
  vendor nearest

step Blind Mary
  tip Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire, above the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery.
  turnin 149
  accept 154

step Madame Eva
  turnin 154
  accept 157

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West again

step Abercrombie
  tip Ride west along the road once more.
  turnin 157
  accept 158

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 230                              -- Sven Yorgen
  accept 262
  turnin 226                              -- Lars

step Back to Darkshire
  tip Ride back east to Darkshire.
  turnin 262                              -- Madame Eva
  accept 265
  turnin 265                              -- Clerk Daltry, in the town hall
  accept 266
  turnin 266                              -- Tavernkeep Smitts, in the tavern
  accept 453
  turnin 158                              -- Tavernkeep Smitts
  accept 156

step Rot Blossoms
  tip Skeletal Horrors walk the hillside between Darkshire and the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south-east of town; they drop the Rot Blossoms.
  collect 1598 quest 156

step Tavernkeep Smitts
  turnin 156
  accept 159
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Raven Hill

step Abercrombie
  tip Ride west to the hermit once more.
  turnin 159
  accept 133

step Ghoul Ribs
  tip Every ghoul of the Raven Hill Cemetery's northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters.
  collect 884 quest 133

step Abercrombie
  turnin 133

step Jitters
  tip Jitters hides in the house at the west end of Raven Hill.
  turnin 453
  accept 268

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 268                              -- Sven Yorgen
  note Next: Stormwind for training, then the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine for Ashenvale.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rogues: Klaven's Tower

step Agent Kearnen
  only Rogue
  zone Westfall
  tip Ride west along the road out of Raven Hill into Westfall. Agent Kearnen watches Klaven Mortwake's tower from the hills just inside the border. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23) guarding the tower carries its key; Klaven's journal is in the chest at the top.
  turnin 2360                                 -- Agent Kearnen
  accept 2359
  collect 7923 quest 2359.2                   -- Defias Tower Key: Malformed Defias Drone
  collect 7908 quest 2359.1                   -- Klaven Mortwake's Journal, in the chest

step Master Mathias Shaw
  only Rogue
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Ride north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town.
  turnin 2359 reward 18160                    -- Master Mathias Shaw: Poisons, and Recipe: Thistle Tea
  accept 2607 optional                        -- The Touch of Zanzil: Doc Mixilpixil, in the cellar of the Barracks
  turnin 2607 optional
  accept 2608 optional
  complete 2608 optional                      -- /lay down beside Doc Mixilpixil
  turnin 2608 optional
  accept 2609 optional
  buy 3421 x1 npc 1302 optional               -- Simple Wildflowers: Bernard Gump
  buy 3372 x1 npc 1313 optional               -- Leaded Vial: Maria Lumere, Alchemy Supplies
  buy 4371 x1 npc 5519 optional               -- Bronze Tube: Billibub Cogspinner, Dwarven District
  collect 8431 quest 2609.4 optional @50.6,60.1 live -- Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread
  turnin 2609 optional                        -- Doc Mixilpixil: Eau de Mixilpixil

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind and the boat

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Train in Stormwind, north through Elwynn Forest. Then take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid -- Level 22 and 24 spells

step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the Auberdine boat.
  train class
